  "description": "FUYTIG crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system with space group P 65. Reported CIF formula moiety: (C92 H152 Ce4 N4 O24)n. From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce13 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce23 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce1_2 (Ce) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.115-4.215 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.67-111.14°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ce(O2CCH2tBu)3(py)].",
